{"name":"Beanpole","hex":"#4e8747","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"beanpole","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thin pole for supporting bean vines.","A tall, thin person."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beanpole"}],"entries":[{"title":"Beanpole (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Beanpole is a 2019 Russian drama film directed and co-written by Kantemir Balagov. It premiered in the Un Certain Regard section of the 2019 Cannes Film Festival. At Cannes, Balagov won the Un Certain Regard Best Director Award and the FIPRESCI Prize for Best Film in the Un Certain Regard section. It was selected as the Russian entry for the Best International Feature Film at the 92nd Academy Awards, making the December shortlist."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b1/Beanpole_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beanpole_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b1/Beanpole_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b1/Beanpole_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABeanpole_(film).jpg"}],"sounds":{"beanpole":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/ff/En-us-beanpole.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/ff/En-us-beanpole.ogg/En-us-beanpole.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Cleora cinctaria catepillar (top view) - Kulna","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Cleora_cinctaria_catepillar_%28top_view%29_-_Kulna.jpg/500px-Cleora_cinctaria_catepillar_%28top_view%29_-_Kulna.jpg","ratio":0.